    "geo" : { },
    "id_str" : "934067585301340160",
    "text" : "\"Theory is when you know something, but it doesn\u2019t work. Practice is when something works, but you don\u2019t know why. Programmers combine theory and practice: Nothing works and they don\u2019t know why.\" - Unknown",
