  "in_reply_to_user_id" : 87109517,
  "text" : "@MattZionWE @youngblackcon Travel is not mentioned in the Constitution. Hence, it is included in the Tenth Amendment. Driving licences are an abridgement of the natural right to travel. Carry licenses are an abridgement of the natural right of self defense.\n\nThe Bill of Rights grants nothing.",
