  "in_reply_to_user_id" : 3187342798,
  "text" : "@digitarald I would also like a feature to break on warnings (NOT in Chrome's dev tools). I'm currently debugging a CORS error. I know it's a CORS error, because of a warning message. I can debug it by using the Network panel to look at headers, but sometimes a stack backtrace would help.",
