  "text" : "@Lispegistus @p_nathan There are definitely some commie countries that I prefer to others. But more and more I don't care about the distinctions. They all steal a lot of my money. And give me very little in return. The Edward Abbey quote about the rule of law comes to mind. I'll find it if you can't.",
