  "text" : "@jessemcnelis I have health insurance so that I can pay for an expensive hospital stay, should it be forced on me. I would much rather have separation of medicine and state, so that a hospital stay would cost 1\/10 or 1\/100 of its current price. Then I might not need health insurance.",
