  "text" : "@ardrigh @drewbeck @jlev My current doctor has a standard medical license, it being difficult in America to find a doctor who doesn't. Long ago, I used a naturopath for my children. They survived. Likely because his ethics were actually \"do no harm\", not \"unless a pharmaceutical company can make $$\".",
