  "in_reply_to_status_id_str" : "930122810688724992",
  "geo" : { },
  "id_str" : "930128882224844800",
  "in_reply_to_user_id" : 775336357728292864,
  "text" : "@OwenMacdonald8 I don't put people in groups, so the term \"transphobic\" has no meaning to me. Like racist. Race is not a meaningful concept. Sex is. If I want my own kids, I have to find a female who wants to help me. Most mammals have an unignorable urge to do that. If you don't, don't.",
