  "in_reply_to_user_id" : 775336357728292864,
  "text" : "@OwenMacdonald8 \"I won't change my flawed and bigoted worldview because transphobia doesn't personally affect me\"\n\nClose. Not bigoted. I judge every person by their choices, not things about them they do not control. But I owe nobody anything I didn't explicitly agree to, except non-aggression.",
