    "text" : "Legal #gun owners are tired of giving an inch in the name of compromise, only to have #guncontrol demand another inch. That's not compromise, it's removing a right incrementally. We don't want an inch back, we want the whole yard stick you took.\n#GunRights #MolonLabe",
