    "text" : "If your employer shorted you $2,000  and donated it to schools\/roads\/hospitals you would call it theft. \n\nInstead people vote for politicians who pass legislation that shorts you out of $2,000 for schools\/roads\/hospitals and they call it taxation. \n\nNeither requires consent.",
